0..66 Comment "/// This source calls recursions staged past their first parameter"
67..87 Comment "/// at named values."
88..91 Comment "///"
92..166 Comment "/// It pins how the kernel unfolds a constant at a staged fixpoint\'s gate."
167..170 Comment "///"
171..251 Comment "/// The lowering stages `le` under its second-parameter case. Its fixpoint takes"
252..329 Comment "/// the first parameter as a leading argument. At a named value, the fixpoint"
330..407 Comment "/// stops at the gate. The checker unfolds the name there. The kernel replays"
408..467 Comment "/// this step at the staged argument before the gate opens."
468..471 Comment "///"
472..488 Comment "/// - see: #3387"
